    "description": {
      "value": "<em>Replace this with a proper description.</em>\n<details>\n<summary>Credits and Instructions</summary>\n<h2>Made by Elwin</h2>\n<h3>Requires:</h3>\n<ul>\n   <li>Times-up (less than v14)</li>\n   <li>Elwin Helpers (Enable in Settings)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Usage:</strong></p>\n<p>This item is used as a factory to create Blade of Medusa swords.\nThe enchantment adds an on use macro that activates the Medusa Effect activity on the attacker or target depending on the attack roll when an attack is made with the enchanted sword.\n@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> The cursed condition is only added when attuned and equipped, DAE does not provide an event only for attuned.\nThere is no specific way to identify if a creature is made of flesh or not, in case the effect should not have been applied to a target, it should be deleted manually.</p>\n</details>",
      "chat": ""
    },
